# Cloudflare Pages redirects for the dashboard.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Routing is hash based (#/projects, #/connectors, ...), so no SPA fallback is
# needed and every deep link is served by index.html directly.
#
# Uncomment this to proxy the API through Pages and avoid CORS entirely, then
# open the dashboard once with ?api=/api (the choice is remembered in
# localStorage):
#
# /api/*  https://your-api-host/:splat  200
#
# Or send bare visitors to the live API's own copy of the dashboard:
#
# /  https://your-api-host/ui/  302
